# Flap Token Launcher works with zero environment variables - image/metadata
# is pinned via Flap's own official API (https://funcs.flap.sh/api/upload).
#
# Optional: set this to enable a second pinning attempt via Pinata if Flap's
# own upload API is ever briefly unavailable. Get a free JWT at
# https://app.pinata.cloud/developers/api-keys (no paid plan required).
# Leave unset to rely on Flap's API alone.
PINATA_JWT=
